WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.152 --> 00:00:04.653
Hopian: I thought you three would never wake up.

2
00:00:04.673 --> 00:00:08.816
Tina: Wow, Hopian, are those your fancy clothes?

3
00:00:10.557 --> 00:00:11.257
Hopian: Yes.

4
00:00:11.437 --> 00:00:19.081
I wear them only on the most special occasions.

5
00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:34.261
Brad: Like when there is a Ginormous feast?

6
00:00:36.981 --> 00:00:38.822
Bello: Handsome.

7
00:00:38.842 --> 00:00:40.682
Tina: Yes, Bello.

8
00:00:40.782 --> 00:00:42.203
You do look handsome.

9
00:00:42.223 --> 00:00:45.844
Brad: Hopian, we don't have any fancy clothes.

10
00:00:45.864 --> 00:00:48.485
Brad: We have only the clothes we are wearing.

11
00:00:48.505 --> 00:00:50.925
Hopian: No one will mind.

12
00:00:51.525 --> 00:00:53.266
You are the guests of honor.

13
00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:55.727
Tina: But we look so bad.

14
00:00:55.747 --> 00:01:02.208
Danny: Hopian, do you have any more ties?

15
00:01:02.989 --> 00:01:07.790
Hopian: Here you go.

16
00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:10.351
They are too big for you, I think.

17
00:01:10.371 --> 00:01:12.051
Danny: Don't worry.

18
00:01:17.673 --> 00:01:21.854
Brad: Cool!

19
00:01:21.874 --> 00:01:25.355
Tina: But this is a boy's suit!

20
00:01:25.415 --> 00:01:28.275
Danny: I'm not perfect!

21
00:01:28.295 --> 00:01:30.236
Hopian: Come on, children!

22
00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:31.861
We can't be late.

23
00:01:36.826 --> 00:01:40.389
Hopian: Are you three ready?

24
00:01:40.489 --> 00:01:42.451
All three: You bet!

25
00:01:49.257 --> 00:01:50.779
They're bowing to us!

26
00:01:51.519 --> 00:01:53.241
Giants are bowing to us!

27
00:01:53.261 --> 00:01:55.703
Tina: This is the coolest thing ever!

28
00:02:02.008 --> 00:02:03.710
Governor: Hello, my dear friends.

29
00:02:03.730 --> 00:02:10.836
Governor: Please join me in welcoming our guests of honor, [n3@Danny, Brad, and Tina!

30
00:02:13.478 --> 00:02:15.400
Tina: Wow!

31
00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:18.082
All these giants are cheering for us.

32
00:02:18.102 --> 00:02:22.626
Danny: Yeah, if only the bullies at school could see us now.

33
00:02:22.646 --> 00:02:25.569
Brad: No one would believe us if we told them.

34
00:02:25.589 --> 00:02:29.092
Governor: Please be seated, everyone.

35
00:02:30.028 --> 00:02:33.410
Governor: We will now begin the honorary feast of Ginormous.

36
00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:37.932
Governor: Children, your special seats are right here.

37
00:02:39.033 --> 00:02:41.274
Brad: Um, those look a bit high.

38
00:02:41.294 --> 00:02:45.576
Tina: If you don't mind, Governor, we would rather sit on the table.

39
00:02:45.596 --> 00:02:48.338
Danny: Thanks, Hopian.

40
00:02:48.698 --> 00:02:54.241
Hopian: This is how they like to eat at my house.

41
00:02:54.261 --> 00:02:55.802
Governor: I see.

42
00:02:56.202 --> 00:02:59.684
Well, I guess the table will be our new seat of honor!

43
00:03:00.928 --> 00:03:03.529
Brad: All this honor is making me hungry!

44
00:03:10.772 --> 00:03:11.652
Oh my gosh!

45
00:03:11.932 --> 00:03:13.053
Look at all the food!

46
00:03:13.073 --> 00:03:15.534
Brad: It's a gigantic feast!

47
00:03:16.334 --> 00:03:17.975
Tina: It's an enormous feast!

48
00:03:19.115 --> 00:03:21.036
All three: It's a Ginormous feast!

49
00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:40.861
Danny: I wish this moment could last forever.

50
00:03:40.881 --> 00:03:43.963
Hopian: You know what I think, Danny?

51
00:03:43.983 --> 00:03:45.444
Danny: What?

52
00:03:45.464 --> 00:03:49.446
Hopian: I think parents will tell their children about you.

53
00:03:49.466 --> 00:03:52.688
Hopian: And those children will tell their children.

54
00:03:52.708 --> 00:03:59.412
Hopian: In the future, giants will still tell the story [n3@of Danny, Tina, and Brad.

55
00:03:59.432 --> 00:04:06.536
Hopian: This moment will last forever, Danny, because the people [n3@of Ginormous will remember it.
